        "tab_W78wqt": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SHIPPING & RETURNS",
            "content": "<h3>🇮🇳 Shipping Within India</h3><p>ZEVVAR ships to <strong>all serviceable pin codes across India</strong>. We work with trusted and professional logistics partners to ensure your jewellery is handled with care and delivered safely and on time.</p><h3>🚚 Order Dispatch</h3><ul><li>Orders are generally <strong>dispatched within 2 working days</strong> from the date of order confirmation</li><li>An <strong>estimated delivery date</strong> may be shown at checkout; this is only an approximation and not a guaranteed delivery date</li><li>Once your order is shipped, you will receive an <strong>email notification with dispatch details</strong></li><li>In case of any processing delays, our team will proactively inform you with updated timelines</li></ul><h3>📍 Order Tracking</h3><p>After dispatch, you will receive:</p><ul><li>A <strong>tracking URL</strong></li><li>The <strong>AWB (Air Waybill) number</strong></li></ul><p>You can track your shipment using the details shared on your registered email ID.</p><h3>📦 Order Delivery Timelines</h3><p>Delivery timelines (excluding weekends and public holidays) are approximately:</p><ul><li><strong>Metro cities:</strong> 3–4 working days</li><li><strong>Non-metro cities:</strong> 8–9 working days</li></ul><p>Delivery timelines may vary due to unforeseen operational issues. ZEVVAR is <strong>not responsible for delays caused by natural calamities, strikes, or other unavoidable circumstances</strong>.</p><h3>⚠️ Damaged or Tampered Packages</h3><p>If you believe your package is <strong>tampered with or damaged</strong> at the time of delivery:</p><ul><li><strong>Do not accept the delivery</strong></li><li>Immediately contact us at <strong>+91 9830008086</strong></li><li>Or email us at <a><strong>team.zevvar@gmail.com</strong></a>with your order number</li></ul><p>Our team will investigate and provide a resolution at the earliest.</p><h3>📱 Mandatory Mobile Number for Delivery</h3><p>A <strong>10-digit Indian mobile number</strong> is mandatory for deliveries within India.</p><ul><li>Our logistics partners follow <strong>OTP-based delivery verification</strong></li><li>Failure to provide or receive the OTP may result in <strong>non-delivery</strong></li><li>If the package returns to our warehouse due to OTP failure, <strong>additional shipping charges will apply</strong></li><li>Re-shipping costs in such cases will be <strong>borne by the customer</strong></li></ul><h2>🌍 International Shipping (Outside India)</h2><p>Each international order undergoes <strong>multiple quality checks</strong> before dispatch to ensure perfection and safety.</p><ul><li>International orders are typically delivered within <strong>15 days from the order date</strong></li><li>While processing may take time, international transit is generally quick</li><li>In rare cases of delay, please contact us at<br/><a><strong>team.zevvarfashion@gmail.com</strong></a>for assistance and updates</li></ul><h2>💰 Shipping Charges</h2><h3>🇮🇳 Shipping Charges Within India</h3><ul><li><strong>Free shipping</strong> on all <strong>prepaid orders</strong></li><li><strong>₹100 cash-handling/shipping charge</strong> applicable on all <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong> orders</li></ul><h3>🌍 International Shipping Charges</h3><ul><li>International shipping charges are calculated based on <strong>product weight</strong></li><li>Charges are <strong>automatically added at checkout</strong></li><li>All international shipments are sent on a <strong>DDU (Delivery Duty Unpaid)</strong> basis</li></ul><p>📌 Please Note:</p><ul><li>Product prices and shipping charges <strong>do not include import duties, customs duties, or local taxes</strong></li><li>The recipient is responsible for <strong>all import duties and taxes</strong> levied by their country</li><li>Failure to pay duties may result in:Shipment held at customsShipment returned to our warehouse</li></ul><p>In such cases:</p><ul><li><strong>Shipping charges are non-refundable</strong></li><li>Return charges imposed by the delivery partner will be <strong>deducted from the refund (if applicable)</strong></li></ul><h3>📌 Address Accuracy Policy</h3><p>Any delivery address entered at checkout and confirmed by the customer is considered <strong>final</strong>.</p><ul><li>Incorrect, incomplete, or changed addresses <strong>will not be eligible for refunds</strong></li><li>Customers are requested to <strong>double-check shipping and billing details</strong> before placing the order</li><li>Additional delivery or return charges arising due to incorrect address details will be <strong>borne by the customer</strong></li></ul><p>We make things that work better and last longer.</p><p>We make things that work better and last longer.</p><p>We make things that work better and last longer.</p><p>We make things that work better a</p>"
          }
        },
